//RS         // A generator: the second run was exit 101, an ICE out of
//RS         // `get_function_decl`, while every cold run stayed correct.
//RS         ("Examples/features/streams/generators.jet", false, false),
//RS         // A `#CLI` typed entry, so the run arrives through a CLI adapter.
//RS         ("Examples/features/cli/typed_entry_args.jet", false, false),
//RS         // The #2011 row: an unhandled default `Err` at the edge exits 1 cold and
//RS         // exited 0 warm. A replay that drops the error rail prints the same
